---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Aegis-Beacon v5.4 — Open Source Emergency Radio System"
  description="Low-cost emergency radio-location system based on LoRa for mountain rescue and SAR operations."
>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HERO
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="hero-wrap">
  <span class="bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="bg-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <section class="hero-section container">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">
        <span class="hero__eyebrow-dot"></span>
        Open Source Emergency Radio
      </p>
      <h1 class="hero__headline">Aegis-Beacon</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">v5.4 // LoRa Emergency System</p>
      <p class="hero__desc">
        Low-cost emergency radio-location system based on LoRa. Designed for mountain rescue,
        land operations, and critical civilian scenarios when cellular infrastructure is unavailable.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a href="/wiki/project-overview" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Wiki</a>
        <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-secondary">Live Demo</a>
        <a href="/builder" class="btn btn-secondary">BOM Builder</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">$23–28</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Total BOM</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">410–525</span>
          <span class="stat-label">MHz Band</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">65h+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Runtime</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">15 km</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Max Range</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">10 µA</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Deep Sleep</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-value">4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Modes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     FEATURES
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section container" data-animate>
  <header class="section-head">
    <p class="section-head__eyebrow">Core Capabilities</p>
    <h2 class="section-head__title">Every component selected for reliability</h2>
    <p class="section-head__lead">When lives depend on it, there's no room for compromise.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>Long-Range Emergency Radio</h3>
      <p>SX1262 transceiver with +30 dBm PA delivers emergency beacon transmissions up to 15 km line-of-sight across the 410–525 MHz band.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>Ultra-Low Power Design</h3>
      <p>Deep sleep at 10 µA with 30-second hardware watchdog. WiFi and Bluetooth disabled in beacon mode for maximum battery life.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>No Infrastructure Required</h3>
      <p>No GSM, WiFi, or commercial satellite needed. Direct peer-to-peer radio communication works anywhere in the wilderness.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>MIT Licensed Open Source</h3>
      <p>Full source code, hardware schematics, and BOM under MIT license. Community-driven development with PlatformIO support.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>CW Morse Beacon with GPS</h3>
      <p>Continuous-wave beacon transmitting SOS and GPS coordinates for search-and-rescue operations. Compliant with PMR446 protocols.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card" data-animate>
      <h3>WiFi Config Portal</h3>
      <p>Captive portal at 192.168.4.1 for field configuration. Adjust frequencies, WPM, power output, and GPS settings without reflashing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     OPERATING MODES
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section-alt" data-animate>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="section-head__eyebrow">Operating Modes</p>
      <h2 class="section-head__title">From passive beacon to emergency high-power output</h2>
      <p class="section-head__lead">Four distinct modes for every field scenario.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="modes-grid">
      <div class="mode-card" data-animate>
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">BEACON</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">01</span>
        </div>
        <p>Transmits Morse SOS with GPS coordinates on all configured frequencies, then enters deep sleep cycle for maximum runtime.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: +17 dBm</span>
          <span>LED: Red</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card" data-animate>
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">SEARCH</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">02</span>
        </div>
        <p>Scans all frequencies sequentially, measuring RSSI on each. Rising-pitch audio alert when signal is detected.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>Rx only</span>
          <span>LED: Blue</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card" data-animate>
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">CONFIG</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">03</span>
        </div>
        <p>WiFi AP mode with captive portal dashboard. Adjust all settings via browser without reflashing the firmware.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>WiFi AP</span>
          <span>LED: Both</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card" data-animate>
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">EMERGENCY</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">04</span>
        </div>
        <p>Maximum power continuous TX with full payload. No deep sleep. 1760 Hz audible tone for critical rescue situations.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: +22 dBm</span>
          <span>LED: Fast</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     TECH STACK
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section container" data-animate>
  <header class="section-head">
    <p class="section-head__eyebrow">Technology Stack</p>
    <h2 class="section-head__title">Powered by industry-standard components</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="tech-grid">
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>ESP32</strong> Dual-Core MCU</div>
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>SX1262</strong> LoRa Transceiver</div>
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>SSD1309</strong> OLED Display</div>
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>NEO-6M</strong> GPS Module</div>
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>RadioLib</strong> RF Library</div>
    <div class="tech-chip"><strong>PlatformIO</strong> Build System</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     FAQ
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section-alt" data-animate>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-head__title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="faq">
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>What is the total cost to build an Aegis-Beacon?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">The complete bill of materials costs between $23 and $28 depending on sourcing. All components are readily available from AliExpress or local electronics stores. No specialized tools beyond a soldering iron are needed.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>Does it require any cellular or internet connection?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">No. Aegis-Beacon uses direct peer-to-peer LoRa radio communication. It works entirely offline — no GSM, WiFi, or satellite subscription is needed for emergency beacon operation. WiFi is only used in Config mode for local settings adjustment.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>What is the maximum range?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">Up to 15 km line-of-sight with the included antenna at +17 dBm TX power. In Emergency mode, continuous transmission at +22 dBm extends range further. Real-world range depends on terrain, obstacles, and antenna orientation.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>How long does the battery last?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">In Beacon mode with a standard 18650 cell (3000 mAh), expect 65+ hours of continuous operation. The device enters deep sleep at 10 µA between transmissions, maximizing battery life for extended rescue operations.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>Is this legal to use?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">The device operates in the 410–525 MHz band. Check your local regulations for unlicensed radio operation. In many jurisdictions, low-power emergency beacons are permitted. The firmware supports PMR446-compliant frequencies.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item" name="faq">
        <summary class="faq__question">
          <span>How do I configure the device?</span>
          <svg class="faq__chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M7 7L10 10L13 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">Switch to Config mode to activate the WiFi Access Point. Connect to "AEGIS-SETUP" and open 192.168.4.1 in your browser. The captive portal lets you adjust frequency, WPM, power output, GPS settings, and more — no reflashing required.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     CTA
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cta-section" data-animate>
  <span class="bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="cta-inner container">
    <h2>Ready to Build Your Own?</h2>
    <p>Complete documentation, step-by-step assembly guide, interactive firmware demo, and BOM calculator.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/wiki/project-overview" class="btn btn-white">Full Build Wiki</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Leo-Galli/Aegis-Beacon" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-white">Source Code</a>
      <a href="/builder" class="btn btn-outline-white">BOM Calculator</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<script>
  // FAQ accordion — allow only one open at a time
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('.faq__item').forEach(item => {
    item.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
      if (item.open) {
        document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('.faq__item[open]').forEach(other => {
          if (other !== item) other.open = false;
        });
      }
    });
  });
</script>
